<h1>Video 107</h1>
<h2>Video info</h2>
<p>Title: Core Java With OCJP/SCJP: java.lang.package Part-3 || equals() || overridden methods of equals</p>
<p>Series: java.lang.package (Object class methods — continues from Part-2)</p>
<p>Instructor: Durga Sir</p>
<p>Duration: 1h 28m 24s</p>
<p>Video ID: izDt7L4009k</p>
